  "solution": {
    "text": "After elastic collision,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">υ</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mtext>A</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mtext>m</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mn>9</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mtext>m&nbsp;s</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><br /><br?> Now from conservation of linear momentum after all collisions are complete,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>m</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mtext>m&nbsp;s</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>m</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mtext>m&nbsp;s</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext>m</mtext><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">υ</mi><mtext>C</mtext></msub></mfenced></math><br /><br />or &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">υ</mi><mtext>C</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mtext>m&nbsp;s</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> </br?>"
